00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:51.820
before we get to the audience.

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:53.900
And so I'll ask in fact each of you

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:56.650
to describe your current research

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:59.362
and tell us what ways your
